{"time_ns": 1792763927875921150, "kind": "result", "action_index": 10, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "b458281b007392d407c4112cf6cad2e31524d73450d5549e097824e0e610aba9", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes the regional distribution of transaction amounts across 24 records spanning three geographic regions: North, South, and West.\n\n## Results\n\n### Record Count\nAll 24 records (R001-R024) have been successfully processed.\n\n### Regional Totals (in cents)\n- **North**: $4,983.43 (498,343 cents)\n- **South**: $4,706.81 (470,681 cents)\n- **West**: $3,630.19 (363,019 cents)\n\n### Grand Total\n**$13,320.43** (1,332,043 cents)\n\n## Analysis\nThe North region has the highest total transaction value at approximately 37.4% of the overall total. The South and West regions represent 35.3% and 27.2% respectively, showing a relatively balanced distribution across regions with a slight concentration in the North.\n\n## Data Completeness\nAll 24 records specified in the task have been processed with complete and accurate information.\n", "ok": true}
